{"kind":"html","caption":"用后序遍历分别询问左右子树是否找到了 p 或 q：当前节点命中目标时，也可以直接作为候选结果返回。若左右子树都返回非空，当前节点就是最近公共祖先；若只有一侧非空，则把该侧结果继续向上传递。动画使用示例 2 展示节点 5 如何因命中 p 且子树中含有 q=4，最终成为答案。","html":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>二叉树的最近公共祖先</title>\n<style>\n  * { box-sizing: border-box; }\n  html, body{ margin: 0; background: #1c1c1c; color: #d4d4d4; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"PingFang SC\", sans-serif; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.45; }\n  main{ max-width: 560px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 8px 10px 10px; display: grid; gap: 8px; }\n  h1 { margin: 0; color: #d4d4d4; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; }\n  .sub { margin: 4px 0 0; color: #8d8d8d; font-size: 12px; }\n  .panel { padding: 8px 10px; border: 1px solid #3c3c3c; border-radius: 6px; background: #252526; }\n  .legend { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 6px; margin-top: 6px; font-size: 10px; }\n  .tag { padding: 2px 7px; border: 1px solid #3c3c3c; border-radius: 4px; background: #2d2d30; }\n  .tag.target { border-color: #3794ff; color: #3794ff; }\n  .tree { display: flex; justify-content: center; margin-top: 6px; overflow-x: auto; transform: scale(0.82); transform-origin: top center; }\n  .branch { min-width: 72px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: 6px; }\n  .children { display: flex; gap: 8px; padding-top: 6px; border-top: 1px solid #3c3c3c; }\n  .node { min-width: 44px; padding: 4px 6px; border: 1px solid #3c3c3c; border-radius: 6px; background: #2d2d30; text-align: center; transition: background .35s, border-color .35s; }\n  .value { font: 700 13px \"SF Mono\", Monaco, Menlo, monospace; }\n  .role { min-height: 12px; margin-top: 2px; font-size:10px; color: #8d8d8d; }\n  .node.active { background: #0e639c; border-color: #3794ff; color: #fff; }\n  .node.returned { background: #173d58; border-color: #3794ff; color: #3794ff; }\n  .node.answer { background: #0e639c; border-color: #3794ff; color: #fff; }\n  .status-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 6px; }\n  .card { min-height: auto; padding: 8px 10px; border: 1px solid #3c3c3c; border-radius: 6px; background: #252526; }\n  .label { margin-bottom: 4px; color: #3794ff; font-size: 10px; font-weight: 600; }\n  .mono { font-family: \"SF Mono\", Monaco, Menlo, monospace; }\n  #stepText, #rule { line-height: 1.45; font-size: 12px; }\n  #rule { color: #d4d4d4; }\n  .progress { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(6, 1fr); gap: 4px; margin-top: 6px; }\n  .dot { height: 3px; border-radius: 4px; background: #3c3c3c; }\n  .dot.on { background: #3794ff; }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main>\n  <section>\n    <h1>后序返回“这一棵子树找到了谁”</h1>\n    <p class=\"sub\">示例 2：<span class=\"mono\">p = 5, q = 4</span>。先处理左右子树，再根据两侧返回值决定向父节点交出什么。</p>\n    <div class=\"legend\">\n      <span class=\"tag target\">目标节点：5、4</span>\n      <span class=\"tag\">蓝底：正在处理</span>\n      <span class=\"tag\">蓝框：向上返回非空节点</span>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"panel\">\n    <div class=\"tree\">\n      <div class=\"branch\">\n        <div class=\"node\" data-v=\"3\"><div class=\"value\">3</div><div class=\"role\">根节点</div></div>\n        <div class=\"children\">\n          <div class=\"branch\">\n            <div class=\"node\" data-v=\"5\"><div class=\"value\">5</div><div class=\"role\">p</div></div>\n            <div class=\"children\">\n              <div class=\"branch\"><div class=\"node\" data-v=\"6\"><div class=\"value\">6</div><div class=\"role\">普通节点</div></div></div>\n              <div class=\"branch\">\n                <div class=\"node\" data-v=\"2\"><div class=\"value\">2</div><div class=\"role\">祖先路径</div></div>\n                <div class=\"children\">\n                  <div class=\"branch\"><div class=\"node\" data-v=\"7\"><div class=\"value\">7</div><div class=\"role\">普通节点</div></div></div>\n                  <div class=\"branch\"><div class=\"node\" data-v=\"4\"><div class=\"value\">4</div><div class=\"role\">q</div></div></div>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"branch\">\n            <div class=\"node\" data-v=\"1\"><div class=\"value\">1</div><div class=\"role\">另一子树</div></div>\n            <div class=\"children\">\n              <div class=\"branch\"><div class=\"node\" data-v=\"0\"><div class=\"value\">0</div><div class=\"role\">普通节点</div></div></div>\n              <div class=\"branch\"><div class=\"node\" data-v=\"8\"><div class=\"value\">8</div><div class=\"role\">普通节点</div></div></div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"status-grid\">\n    <div class=\"card\"><div class=\"label\">当前步骤</div><div id=\"stepText\"></div></div>\n    <div class=\"card\"><div class=\"label\">返回值</div><div id=\"returnText\" class=\"mono\"></div></div>\n    <div class=\"card\"><div class=\"label\">判断规则</div><div id=\"rule\"></div></div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"panel\">\n    <div class=\"label\">动画进度</div>\n    <div class=\"progress\" id=\"progress\"></div>\n  </section>\n</main>\n<script>\nconst steps = [\n  {nodes:[4], cls:'active', text:'访问节点 4，当前节点就是目标 q。', ret:'return 4', rule:'命中 p 或 q 时，当前节点本身可以作为祖先候选。'},\n  {nodes:[4,2], cls:'returned', text:'节点 2 的左侧为空，右侧返回 4。', ret:'节点 2 → return 4', rule:'只有一侧非空，就把这一侧找到的节点原样向上传递。'},\n  {nodes:[5], cls:'active', extra:[4,2], text:'回到节点 5：当前节点命中目标 p。', ret:'节点 5 → return 5', rule:'节点可以是自己的祖先，因此命中 p 的节点 5 可以直接返回。'},\n  {nodes:[5], cls:'answer', extra:[4,2], text:'节点 5 的子树中同时包含 q=4，而节点 5 自己就是 p。', ret:'最近公共祖先 = 5', rule:'5 是同时覆盖 p、q 的最深节点，所以答案是 5。'},\n  {nodes:[3], cls:'active', extra:[5], text:'返回根节点 3：左侧得到已经确定的节点 5，右侧与目标无关。', ret:'节点 3 → return 5', rule:'单侧非空时继续上传该结果，不会把更高的节点误选为答案。'},\n  {nodes:[5], cls:'answer', extra:[], text:'遍历结束。最终返回节点 5。', ret:'输出：5', rule:'公共祖先不一定在两个目标的上方，也可能正是其中一个目标。'}\n];\nconst allNodes = [...document.querySelectorAll('.node')];\nconst progress = document.getElementById('progress');\nsteps.forEach(() => { const d=document.createElement('div'); d.className='dot'; progress.appendChild(d); });\nlet index = 0;\nfunction showStep(){\n  const s = steps[index];\n  allNodes.forEach(n => n.classList.remove('active','returned','answer'));\n  s.extra.forEach(v => document.querySelector('[data-v=\"'+v+'\"]').classList.add('returned'));\n  s.nodes.forEach(v => document.querySelector('[data-v=\"'+v+'\"]').classList.add(s.cls));\n  document.getElementById('stepText').textContent = s.text;\n  document.getElementById('returnText').textContent = s.ret;\n  document.getElementById('rule').textContent = s.rule;\n  [...progress.children].forEach((d,i) => d.classList.toggle('on', i === index));\n  index = (index + 1) % steps.length;\n}\nshowStep();\nsetInterval(showStep, 1900);\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>","svg":"","media":""}
